Welcome to Black City.{VAR BE01}
This is the city of dreams, greed, and
more greed.{VAR BE01}
And I am Black City's boss, so I'm
a whirlpool of greed!{VAR BE01}

This city is filled with vibrant people
who are like big piles of greed.{VAR BE01}
Hmm. Try defeating {VAR 0204 0000} of the
people outside.{VAR BE01}
Then I'll respond to your greed.{VAR BE01}

What?
You've already beaten {VAR 0204 0000} people?{VAR BE01}
You...
You're a greedier one than I expected.{VAR BE00}
Deep down, you want a lot.{VAR BE01}
I like you!
I'll respond to your greed.{VAR BE01}

Wow! You're the best!{VAR BE01}
You're definitely the greediest
of the greedy!{VAR BE01}
You put the other greedies to shame!

Prepare three Pokémon for battle, OK?{VAR BE01}
Rotation Battle is a new kind of battle
that uses three Pokémon at a time!
